{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e <i>Forge Synergy. Shape Fate. Score Big.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rogue-lite match-3 game where every match is a move toward mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine radiant gems with enchanted scrolls, wield artisan tools, and unlock relics to craft powerful scoring engines. Each run offers a fresh bag of modifiers, boons, and build paths\u2014designed for tinkerers, and strategists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964490/extras/9477e11880d39e2847296b8c33777c21.avif?t=1774234892\" width=64 height=64 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964490/extras/3699cb7a205a1cc039b542fc19144fdc.avif?t=1774234892\" width=64 height=64 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964490/extras/12a245c227b33694d18450801ac9f5a9.avif?t=1774234892\" width=64 height=64 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964490/extras/eda753a523db0716a94b64f054ae3c76.avif?t=1774234892\" width=64 height=64 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964490/extras/4765127b0f41d34a6716c229e8cd8194.avif?t=1774234892\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddff <i>Match. Modify. Master.</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gem Matching, Reinvented</strong>: Score by matching colors, then amplify with scrolls, tools, and relics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scrolls &amp; Tools</strong>: Scrolls boost your score. Tools enhance your gems. Combine them for explosive synergy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relics &amp; Charms</strong>: Level up gem colors for stronger base scores. Purchase charms for permanent run modifiers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bag-Building Strategy</strong>: Each gem bag has a unique identity. Level it up to unlock new scrolls and boons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boons &amp; Builds</strong>: Choose your starting boon to define your run\u2014whether you favor precision, chaos, or combo madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964490/extras/87a90e8121c0235a9e2d7c7054541ec3.avif?t=1774234892\" width=64 height=64 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964490/extras/74f5a5838affadbc5ad73ab77de585e0.avif?t=1774234892\" width=64 height=64 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964490/extras/4516feee2d3827368c8fb9cf2e38821d.avif?t=1774234892\" width=64 height=64 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964490/extras/1a767f3385fad058497d6e76d24caa3c.avif?t=1774234892\" width=64 height=64 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964490/extras/606dd313f0cc3a066f064b5aa54aee42.avif?t=1774234892\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <i>Crafted for Depth</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >75+ Scrolls, Tools, Relics, and Charms to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 Gem Bags with Unique Modifiers</